    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Meet the tracy orthodontics team"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Meet The Tracy, CA, Orthodontics Team Of Dante Gonzales Orthodontics"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We are especially interested in making all our patients feel right at home! We put your needs first to achieve efficient and comprehensive treatment. Our staff is trained and skilled, and we strive to provide energetic and fun-loving service to each patient. Each member of our treatment team is a registered dental assistant, and our office staff has years of experience in treating patients with the highest level of care. We strive to stay abreast of the latest in technological advances by regularly attending continuing education courses and seminars."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/tracy-team-photo-01.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Cassie"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Scheduling Coordinator"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Cassie is our newest member to our team. This is her first time in the orthodontics field and is excited to work in a new industry. She has always worked in the customer service capacity and prides herself on delivering the best customer service possible. She lives in Mountain House with her husband and 5 children."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-04.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Colleen"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Clinical Supervisor/ RDA"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Colleen has enjoyed her career as a Registered Dental Assistant in Orthodontics since 1984. She completed her assisting program at the College of Alameda. With Colleen’s dental knowledge, she is bound to have the answers to any of your questions. She is also a mother of four and proud that her only daughter decided to follow in her footsteps, as an orthodontic assistant. Colleen is an avid animal lover and loves working in her garden."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/tracy-team-photo-02.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Sabrina"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Clinical Supervisor.Office Manager"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Bio coming soon.!"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/tracy-team-photo-03.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Amanda"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Chairside RDA/OA"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Bio coming soon.!"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/tracy-team-photo-04.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Stacy"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Chairside RDA."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Bio coming soon.!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "5-STAR-RATED ORTHODONTIST IN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "DUBLIN & TRACY CALIFORNIA (CA), FOR BRACES & INVISALIGN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzales and his staff are truly outstanding. They have an excellent manner with children, while being extremely competent and professional. I would feel comfortable recommending their services to anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "George C"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/ui/star-rating.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We are extremely pleased with Dr. Gonzales and his wonderful staff. He and his staff are patient and understanding and they make my son feel completely at ease. They make every visit stress-free and fun for siblings who have to wait in the waiting room too! *thumbs up* Thank you!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Betty W"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/ui/star-rating.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Best orthodontic office in the bay area!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Colleen R"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/ui/star-rating.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The Smith family loves this office! I am so thankful my kids get to go to Dr Gonzales! Thanks for making us feel so special every time we walk in the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Laurie S"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/ui/star-rating.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzalez and his team always gave excellent service. Staff is very friendly and always made my daughter feel relaxed. She has a beautiful smile. Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Tammy F"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/ui/star-rating.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
